# Stage 5E derived data: same rule as Stage 5D.  The manifest, sampling
# profiles, composition and the small reports stay versioned; the large
# per-image CSVs and the holdout file index stay on disk and are recorded
# with their SHA-256 in reports/stage5e_final_report.md.
